{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToAddAPermanentLicense"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"How to Add a Permanent License"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sell a lifetime entitlement alongside a subscription and surface both flags through the paywall plugin."}],"kind":"article","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoaddapermanentlicense"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"How-to-Guides","title":"How-to Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Many apps offer two ways to buy: a recurring pro subscription and a one-time lifetime purchase. RevenueCat models both as entitlements; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"text":" checks each independently and surfaces them as the two flags on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"type":"text","text":" — active subscription."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":" — active lifetime entitlement."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The paywall plugin’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isGateSatisfied"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro || hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":", so feature code keeps a single check while UI can branch on the underlying flags when it needs to.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For the entitlement-mapping rules and edge cases, see ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Before-you-start","level":2,"text":"Before you start"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide assumes:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You have completed "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You have configured "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"two"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entitlements in the RevenueCat dashboard — typically "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pro"},{"type":"text","text":" for the subscription and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lifetime"},{"type":"text","text":" for the one-time purchase. The identifiers are arbitrary; only the strings need to match what you pass into the service."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-1-Pass-the-second-identifier","level":2,"text":"Step 1: Pass the second identifier"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Replace the single-entitlement init with the two-arg form:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","","let service = RevenueCatPaywallService(","    entitlementID: \"pro\",","    permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Both entitlements are now checked on every ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customerInfo()"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customerInfoStream()"},{"text":" yield, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"restorePurchases()"},{"text":" call. The active state of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pro"},{"text":" flows into ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot.isPro"},{"text":"; the active state of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lifetime"},{"text":" flows into ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The two flags are independent. A user with both active gets both flags set; a user with only one active gets only that flag set.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-2-Wire-the-service-into-the-plugin","level":2,"text":"Step 2: Wire the service into the plugin"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Same as the single-entitlement case — the plugin doesn’t need to know about the second identifier:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["plugins.register(","    PaywallPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","        state: \\.paywall,","        action: AppAction.paywall,","        extractAction: { if case .paywall(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","        service: RevenueCatPaywallService(","            entitlementID: \"pro\",","            permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"","        )","    )",")"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-3-Decide-whether-feature-code-needs-to-branch","level":2,"text":"Step 3: Decide whether feature code needs to branch"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For most gated features, keep using ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.paywall.isGateSatisfied"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if store.paywall.isGateSatisfied { … }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This stays correct whether the user has a subscription or a lifetime license, and works identically in apps that don’t sell a lifetime SKU.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-4-Branch-in-UI-when-copy-must-differ","level":2,"text":"Step 4: Branch in UI when copy must differ"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the paywall sheet should be hidden for lifetime customers (so they’re not pestered to subscribe), or if the customer-center entry should be relabeled, branch on the underlying flag:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if store.paywall.hasPermanentLicense {","    Text(\"Lifetime member — thank you!\")","} else if store.paywall.isPro {","    Button(\"Manage Subscription\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.presentCustomerCenter))","    }","} else {","    Button(\"Upgrade\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.request(reason: \"upgrade-prompt\")))","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Lifetime users typically have nothing to manage in App Store \/ Settings. Hiding the customer-center button for them avoids dead-end taps.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"When-to-skip-the-second-identifier","level":2,"text":"When to skip the second identifier"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" (or omit the parameter) if your app has no lifetime SKU:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["RevenueCatPaywallService(entitlementID: \"pro\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":" then stays ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":" regardless of any entitlements RevenueCat reports — even if the dashboard accidentally has a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lifetime"},{"text":" entitlement that the service is not configured to check. See the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lifetime entitlement is ignored when no permanent-license ID is configured"}]},{"text":" test case for the precise behavior.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToImplementService":{"title":"How to Implement the Service","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","role":"article","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wire "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" into the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin so the store sees real-time entitlement updates from RevenueCat."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoimplementservice"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall","type":"topic","title":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RevenueCat adapter for Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":". Implements "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" against "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Purchases.shared"},{"type":"text","text":", ships a controllable mock for previews and tests, and pairs with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"},{"type":"text","text":" for drop-in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomerCenterView"},{"type":"text","text":" presentation."}],"role":"collection"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/ServiceReference":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"API reference for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" — the RevenueCat-backed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer that the paywall plugin consumes."}],"kind":"article","title":"Service Reference","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/servicereference"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPreviewAndTest":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drive entitlement state from SwiftUI previews and tests with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" — no RevenueCat SDK call required."}],"kind":"article","title":"How to Preview and Test","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopreviewandtest"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPresentTheUI":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopresenttheui","type":"topic","title":"How to Present the UI","abstract":[{"text":"Attach ","type":"text"},{"code":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a root view to present both surfaces from ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or attach either binding-driven primitive by itself.","type":"text"}],"role":"article"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/EntitlementMapping":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/entitlementmapping","type":"topic","title":"Entitlement Mapping","abstract":[{"text":"How RevenueCat’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"CustomerInfo.entitlements","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" translates to Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"article"}}}